    "permalink": "https://getreadycomics.com/shop/the-nightmare-before-christmas-zero-pumpkin-jack-skellington-fall-glow-in-the-dark-disney-loungefly-mini-backpack/",
    "sku": "WDBK4249",
    "short_description": "<h4 data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"527\"><strong>Restocking Soon &#8211; sign up to be notified! </strong></h4>\n<p data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"527\">Celebrate the cozy side of spooky season with this charming <strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"285\">Zero Fall Mini Backpack</strong> from Loungefly! Inspired by <em data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"366\">Disney Tim Burton’s The Nightmare Before Christmas</em>, this autumn-themed design features Jack Skellington’s loyal ghost pup, Zero, playfully surrounded by embroidered fall flowers, a Jack pumpkin, and swirling leaves.</p>\n<p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"848\">Crafted from high-quality faux leather, this warm caramel-toned backpack combines seasonal flair with timeless style. The front pocket offers easy access for your essentials, while the spacious main compartment and adjustable straps make it perfect for everyday adventures — from pumpkin patches to Halloween parties.</p>\n<p data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"864\"><strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"862\">Details:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"1164\">\n<li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"986\">\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"986\">Vegan leather (polyurethane)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1022\">\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1022\">Embroidered and printed details</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1084\">Front zipper pocket, side pockets, and gold-tone hardware</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1116\">\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1116\">Loungefly metal logo plaque</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1164\">\n<p data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1164\">Approx. dimensions: 9&#8243; W x 10.5&#8243; H x 4.5&#8243; D</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
