    "sku": "MYBK0002",
    "short_description": "<p>Step into the afterlife in style with this <strong data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"84\">Loungefly The Mummy Book of the Living Backpack</strong>, a spellbinding accessory inspired by ancient Egyptian mysticism and timeless gothic aesthetics.</p>\n<p data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"592\">Designed to resemble a richly embossed sacred tome, this backpack features intricate detailing throughout—from hieroglyphic-inspired engravings and scarab motifs to the iconic Eye symbol set within a starburst medallion. The textured faux leather gives it the look and feel of an ancient artifact, while the structured “book” silhouette makes it a true statement piece for collectors and fashion lovers alike.</p>\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"903\">The spine-inspired side detailing enhances the illusion of a mystical volume brought to life, and the warm golden-brown tones add a regal, antiquated finish.</p>\n<p data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"918\"><strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"918\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1225\">\n<li data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"972\">\n<p data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"972\">High-quality faux leather with embossed detailing</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1018\">\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1018\">Book-shaped silhouette with spine accents</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1051\">\n<p data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1051\">Top handle for easy carrying</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1103\">\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1103\">Adjustable shoulder straps for comfortable wear</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1133\">\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1133\">Secure zip-around closure</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1176\">\n<p data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1176\">Officially Licensed Universal Product</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1225\">\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1225\">Coordinating interior lining</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
