    "short_description": "<p><strong><em>PRE-ORDER DUE SEPTEMBER</em></strong><br />\n<em>(date subject to change)</em></p>\n<p>Carry your magic with you!<br />\nFor any fan of <i>Practical Magic</i>, this bag is a must! You’ll find the iconic house front and center on the bag. The windows are lenticular! You’ll find more illustrations on the side pockets and cool appliques on the straps!<br />\nStyle your magic this season!</p>\n<p>Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Polyurethane</li>\n<li>Lenticular feature</li>\n<li>Applique, debossed, and printed detailing</li>\n<li>Sturdy top handle</li>\n<li>Adjustable shoulder straps</li>\n<li>Coordinating interior lining</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dimensions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>9”W x 10.5”H x 4.5”D</li>\n<li>22.8cm W x 26.6cm H x 11.4cm D</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is an officially licensed Warner Bros. product.</p>",
