    "short_description": "<p><strong><em>PRE-ORDER DUE SEPTEMBER </em></strong><br />\n<em>(date subject to change)</em></p>\n<p>Disney’s Dr. Facilier is ready to make a sinister deal with this mini backpack. This purple-and-black bag brings this character to life with embroidery, appliques, and a 3D molded metal charm. The side pockets have embroidery too. With its adjustable purple straps and a sturdy top handle, you’ll definitely be ready to conjure up the style spirits.<br />\nShow off one of your favourite Disney Villains with this bag!</p>\n<p>Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pebble polyurethane</li>\n<li>Applique detailing</li>\n<li>Embroidered and printed detailing</li>\n<li>3D molded metal charms</li>\n<li>Sturdy top handle</li>\n<li>Adjustable shoulder straps</li>\n<li>Coordinating interior lining</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dimensions:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>9”W x 10.5”H x 4.5”D</li>\n<li>22.8cm W x 26.6cm H x 11.4cm D</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This is an officially licensed Disney product.</p>",
